 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Golden Hour — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You have the unique ability to manipulate time when you strike a pose.</p></blockquote><p>At 1st level, you can strike a pose and move so quickly it seems as if time has stopped. As a bonus action for 1 cursed energy you can stop time until the end of your turn. During stopped time, you cannot use cursed energy, and are affected by the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You have advantage on all attack rolls against creatures in stopped time.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ranged attacks you make become affected by stopped time and are suspended in mid-air, but finish when time resumes.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Other creatures in stopped time automatically fail Strength and Dexterity saves and cannot use reactions. (A creature can use their reaction against a ranged attack you have made once time has resumed.)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
